# Stone by Sunlight: "Choose one - Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater; or until end of turn, target creature
# becomes an artifact in addition to its other types and gains indestructible." Bot2 controls Gore Swine (4/1, exactly power 4)
# and Barony Vampire (3/2, one under): the first mode destroys the Swine and refuses the Vampire. The second mode on Bot1's
# Bastion Enforcer makes it an Artifact Creature - Dwarf Soldier with indestructible until end of turn (CR 205.1b, 613.1d), and on
# Bot2's turn it is a plain creature again (CR 514.2).

